/-- The Gaussian heat semigroup on `BUCn n`, extended to all real times: identity at `t = 0`
and the `|t|`-convolution otherwise. (The absolute value makes the extension continuous across
`t = 0` on BUC data; the Duhamel map only ever evaluates at nonnegative times.) -/
def gaussianS (n : ℕ) (t : ℝ) : BUCn n →L[ℝ] BUCn n :=
